    silm:hasExample "In 'RepairViaContractAmendmentConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the concrete embodiment of '] _ 17' in the Mittens domain: the body-mass quality bearing 4.7 kg, the vet record signed at 10:00:03 by Dr. Chen, the microchip UID 985112, or the auth-log line under policy CAT-17 on 2026-05-18 -- pinned to the running cat example, never to a bare letter.; also, the concrete embodiment of '_ 17 '' in the Mittens domain: the body-mass quality bearing 4.7 kg, the vet record signed at 10:00:03 by Dr. Chen, the microchip UID 985112, or the auth-log line under policy CAT-17 on 2026-05-18 -- pinned to the running cat example, never to a bare letter.; also, the concrete embodiment of 'PublishedKG' in the Mittens domain: the body-mass quality bearing 4.7 kg, the vet record signed at 10:00:03 by Dr. Chen, the microchip UID 985112, or the auth-log line under policy CAT-17 on 2026-05-18 -- pinned to the running cat example, never to a bare letter.." .

